    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires Attunement by a character with renown in the Ashen Verdict.</em></p><p>This metal band bears a stylized helm, its nose guard and crest made of deep-blue gems. The forge mark of Ormus the Penitent, a stylized O, is stamped inside it.</p><p>While wearing this ring, you gain the following benefits (Ashen Verdict renown required in parentheses).</p><p><strong>Vengeance (Uncommon, Renown 3+).</strong> Your ranged weapon attack rolls ignore Half Cover, and you gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls made with ranged weapons.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-98wpXjcYyF6mWu0l\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Cover and range are applied by the DM.</p></section>",
